-
-Origination can construct and sign against an exactly observed zero-confirmation prefund after its committed binding and preparation prerequisites, but six unchanged confirmations are required for funding-window opening, the pre-`X` gate, and reliance. The initial family contains six activation and six borrower refund candidates at 10, 20, 50, 100, 150, and 200 sat/vB. Terminal packages are constructed only for the actual activation winner after six confirmations. The current package contract specifies six borrower recovery, six lender recovery, and six borrower long-stop variants. A stale SR-002 archive sentence still says twelve terminal packages; this documented source conflict remains for a separate repair. [STATE-008](../../contracts/states/state-008-prefund-and-origination-attempt.md), [STATE-009](../../contracts/states/state-009-bitcoin-package-graph.md), [IFACE-005](../../contracts/interfaces/iface-005-origination-binding-and-package-manifest.md), and [INV-015](../../contracts/invariants/inv-015-zero-confirmation-boundary.md) remain the exact owners.
-
