-
-A P2A anchor permits a separately funded CPFP child. Product export, deterministic unsigned construction, Core's manually unlocked signing/finalization/broadcast, and independent observation stay separate so a fee wallet gains no participant authority. [IFACE-016](../../contracts/interfaces/iface-016-p2a-cpfp-request-helper-and-core.md) owns the arithmetic and operator process. A relay timeout is ambiguous, not permission to send a different transaction; durable exact-attempt reconciliation and independent source agreement govern retry. Wrong binding, stale bytes, contested facts, missing primary archive evidence, or invalid route blocks the affected action.
-
